This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

<system-reminder>
<tools-used-before-summary>Agent, Bash, Edit, Grep, PowerShell, Read, SendUserFile, SubagentHandback, TaskStop, ToolSearch, Write, mcp__Claude_Browser__computer, mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan, mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up</tools-used-before-summary>
