Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   - Integrate the finished pistol into Unreal and replace the placeholder viewmodel.
   - Use Claude Sonnet 5.5 High as implementer, for this chat only.
   - Keep only one asset of the pistol in the project.
   - Show the rounds left on the rear panel with a holographic look.
   - Make the side energy bar drain left to right, not right to left.
   - Make the small light next to the bar (toward the muzzle) light only on weak-point or head hits, and stay off otherwise.
   - Make the number a little smaller, then smaller still and raised so its digits don't hit the panel's dots; focus on that aesthetic.
   - Standing rules:
     - respond in Spanish;
     - devlog, commits and game content in English;
     - commit and push every commit to origin main, never force-push;
     - agents never launch PIE; a human plays;
     - close the Editor only with `Stop-EditorMcp.ps1`;
     - external agents only via `Tools/Devlog/Invoke-LoggedAgent.ps1`;
     - don't spend paid Tripo, Meshy or Hyper3D credits without consent;
     - don't regenerate the gun;
     - assets on CENTRAL live in `Glyphbound/SourceArt`, one copy per asset.

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - Headless Blender 5.3 (`C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Blender\blender.exe`) with bmesh exports.
   - Export frame: 180° turn about Z so the muzzle points +X; origin at the hand point (0.325, 0, 0.0681) in Blender. The FBX import makes the bar end up on -Y in UE.
   - UE 5.9 Python commandlet (`UnrealEditor-Cmd -run=pythonscript -AllowCommandletRendering`).
   - Legacy FBX importer, forced by `Interchange.FeatureFlags.Import.FBX false`, with `FbxImportUI` options.
   - Materials are built from text with `MaterialEditingLibrary`.
   - Dynamic material instances set from C++: `ElementColor`, `ImbueRemaining`, `Flash`, `DisplayTexture`.
   - `UCanvasRenderTarget2D` for the ammo text.
   - Global `UGBCombatLibrary::OnDamageDealt` event for the weak-point flash.
   - `DirectoriesToAlwaysCook` for assets loaded by path.

3. Files and Code Sections:
   - **`Tools/Blender/pistol_export_fbx.py`**: exports 6 parts.
     - Parts: SM_Pistol_Body, Trigger (hinge pivot), Magazine (its own pivot), EnergyBar (13 cells, faces with x > BULB_X = −0.24), WeakPointLight (x ≤ −0.24, material "WeakPoint_Indicator"), AmmoDisplay (quad at Blender x = 0.4395, y ±0.055, z 0.199–0.257, material "Holo_AmmoDisplay").
     - `build(name, sources, pivot, keep_face=None, material=None, extra=None)`.
     - `cell_imbue_u`: U = (i + 0.5)/13 per cell, with i = 0 at the muzzle end.
     - `add_display_plane`: U toward the viewer's right, V up.
     - Writes `export_report.json`: trigger offset (0.2884, 0, 0) m, magazine (0, 0, −0.2931), magazine out (−0.1215, 0, −0.2411), trigger pull −8°.
   - **`Tools/Blender/pistol_prepare_ue.py`**: bakes the textures; saves the `.blend` only `if created` (the ImbueU layer was new).
   - Diagnostic Blender scripts: `pistol_list_objects.py`, `pistol_list_materials.py`, `pistol_bar_layout.py`.
   - **`Tools/Jam/Import-Pistol.ps1`**:
     - runs the Blender prepare and export steps into `Saved\PistolStage_<stamp>`;
     - copies `export_report.json` to `SourceArt/Weapons/Pistol/`;
     - sets `$env:GB_PISTOL_STAGE` and runs the commandlet;
     - deletes the stage folder.
   - **`Tools/Jam/import_pistol.py`**:
     - imports textures and the 6 meshes into `/Game/Glyphbound/Weapons/Pistol`;
     - masters:
       - M_GunSolid, with 14 MI_Pistol_* instances (PBR values per Blender material);
       - M_PistolAtlas (ORM: R = AO, G = roughness, B = metallic; emissive mask × ElementColor × 0.65);
       - M_GunEnergy (lit if OneMinus(UV1.x) < ImbueRemaining; glow 7);
       - M_GunGlass (translucent);
       - M_GunIndicator (ElementColor × 10 × Flash);
       - M_GunHolo (additive unlit: DisplayTexture.R + PaneTint 0.04, scanlines 48, flicker 7 Hz, glow 4);
     - fails if any slot is left without a material;
     - checks 13 distinct UV1 values on the energy bar.
   - **`Glyphbound/Source/Glyphbound/Weapons/GBGun.h/.cpp`** (Muse, then Sonnet):
     - `TryBuildPistolViewModel` builds the 6 parts at scale 0.3 and creates the MIDs; one warning and the placeholder if meshes are missing;
     - `UpdatePistolViewModel` drives: trigger pull 0.12 s to pitch −8; magazine smoothstep out/hold/in; glow (idle green (0.02, 1, 0.07), or the enchant element plus ImbueRemaining = TimeRemaining/TotalDuration);
     - display text cached in `ShownDisplayText` (`Ammo.InMagazine`, or `--` while reloading), drawn by `DrawPistolDisplay`;
     - `HandleDamageDealt` drives the flash: hold `WeakPointFlashHold` 0.12, fade `WeakPointFlashFade` 0.3;
     - `EndPlay` unbinds;
     - latest constants:
       ```
       constexpr float AmmoDisplayTextHeightShare = 0.42f;
       constexpr float AmmoDisplayTextWidthShare = 0.6f;
       constexpr float AmmoDisplayTextCenterY = 0.39f;
